---
description: Next.js TypeScript pages consume content/, no duplicate copy
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# App code

- Import product/site strings from `content/` (or a typed loader). Do not hardcode Kanvra/Solitaire blurbs in JSX.
- App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind. Server Components by default.
- New product route: `/apps/[slug]` or `/games/[slug]` plus `/support` and `/privacy`.
- Example: Kanvra home copy comes from `content/products/kanvra.md`, not from a second paragraph in the page.
